# Applet Reference Pattern

The **Customers applet** (`app/(portal)/portal/customers/`) is the reference implementation for all portal applets. When building a new applet (Products, Orders, Settings, etc.), follow this exact structure.

## File Structure per Applet

```
app/(portal)/portal/<applet>/
  page.tsx            # List page (SelectedItemsProvider wrapper + main component)
  tableColumns.tsx    # Column definitions + dropdownOptions
  tableActions.tsx    # Row action buttons (Edit, Delete, View) with FeedbackModal
  new/page.tsx        # Create form
  [id]/page.tsx       # Detail view
  [id]/edit/page.tsx  # Edit form
```

## List Page Pattern (page.tsx)

Every list page must:
1. Wrap in `<SelectedItemsProvider>` (required by DynamicDropdown and Table selectable)
2. Use these reusable components in this layout:
   - **Header row**: Title on left, `SearchForm` + Add button on right
   - **Filter row**: Type pills on left, `DynamicDropdown` + `DateSelect` + `FilterButton` on right
   - **Table**: `Table` component with `columns`, `actions`, `selectable`, `onSelectionChange`, `isLoading`
   - **Pagination row**: `PageSizeSelect` on left, `PaginationClassic` on right
3. Include `SearchableListModal` for assign-to-agent flows (if applicable)
4. Breadcrumb: `Portal / <Applet Name>`
5. Default `itemsPerPage` to `10`
6. Debounced search (500ms)
6. Filters via `useMemo` building a filters object passed to the service function
7. Page resets to 1 when any filter changes

## Form Pages (new/page.tsx, [id]/edit/page.tsx)

- Breadcrumb navigation at top
- Title below breadcrumb
- Form wrapped in a Mosaic card (`bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 shadow-sm rounded-xl border`)
- Card has `header` (section title), content area (grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2), `footer` (Cancel + Submit)
- `form-input w-full` for all inputs
- After create: redirect to list page (`/portal/<applet>`) -- never to detail page
- After edit: redirect to list page (`/portal/<applet>`) -- never to detail page. No intermediate review screen.
- Edit breadcrumb: `Portal / <Applet> / Edit` -- do NOT link to the detail page in the breadcrumb

## Detail Page ([id]/page.tsx)

- Breadcrumb: `Portal / <Applet> / <Item Name>`
- Title + Edit button in header row
- Details in a Mosaic card with `header` + `grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2` for fields

## Column/Action Files

- `tableColumns.tsx`: Export `columns: TableColumn<any>[]` with `cellRenderer` for each column, and `dropdownOptions` array
- `tableActions.tsx`: Export `actions({ row, onDelete })` returning Edit/Delete/View buttons + `FeedbackModal`

## Key Imports (copy from customers)

```typescript
import Table from '@/components/table/table'
import DynamicDropdown from '@/components/dropdown-dynamic'
import DateSelect from '@/components/date-select'
import FilterButton from '@/components/dropdown-filter'
import SearchForm from '@/components/search-form'
import PaginationClassic from '@/components/pagination-classic'
import PageSizeSelect from '@/components/page-size-select'
import { SearchableListModal } from '@/components/seachable-list-modal'
import { SelectedItemsProvider, useSelectedItems } from '@/app/selected-items-context'
import { useAlert } from '@/app/contexts/alertContext'
```
